# macOS Finder metadata. Ignoring is only half the job — git keeps tracking files it already
# tracks, so the eight that were committed were also `git rm --cached`ed to untrack them
# (they stay on disk). Without that they carry on appearing as modified in every status.
.DS_Store
*.blend1
*.blend1
